---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Portfolio Website" description="Portfolio website case study - Astro, TypeScript, Tailwind, AWS S3+CloudFront, CDK, GitHub Actions OIDC.">
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">Case study</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Portfolio Website</h1>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        This site itself is a portfolio project: static-first Astro with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS, hosted on AWS S3 + CloudFront with Route 53 and ACM, provisioned with CDK, deployed via GitHub Actions with OIDC, and preview deployments for pull requests.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
        <a class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-4 py-1 transition hover:border-teal-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:hover:border-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-400" href="https://github.com/steventclarke/portfolio">GitHub</a>
        <a class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-4 py-1 transition hover:border-teal-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:hover:border-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-400" href="https://portfolio.stevenclarke.dev">Demo</a>
      </div>
    </header>
    <section class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Goals</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <li>Compensate for NDA-bound work with public evidence.</li>
          <li>Demonstrate modern engineering and AWS practices.</li>
          <li>Keep content easy to update without a CMS.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Architecture</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Route 53 → CloudFront (ACM, OAC) → S3. GitHub Actions build and deploy with OIDC, invalidating CloudFront. PR previews served from preview.stevenclarke.dev.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Tradeoffs</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Chose static delivery for speed, security, and low cost (under $10/month). Deferred analytics to stay within budget.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Status</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">In progress. Launch target December 1, 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
